# Verdaca — Clean repo scope
# Only source code, the contract test suite, and brand assets (kernel/, ports/, adapters/, composition/, shell/, scripts/, tests/, assets/) are tracked.
# Everything else (BMAD framework, planning workspace, docs, knowledge, Claude config) is excluded.

# ============================================================
# Step 1: Exclude everything at root by default
# ============================================================
/*

# Step 2: Re-include the Verdaca project directories
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!README.md
!kernel/
!ports/
!composition/
!adapters/
!assets/
!shell/
!tests/
!docs/
!pyproject.toml
!.python-version
!uv.lock

# docs/ holds the verdaca.com website (*.html + styles.css) AND operational
# working docs (handovers, advisor notes, close memos as *.md). Re-include the
# website; keep the operational markdown OUT of the repo/remote.
docs/*.md
docs/*.mp3
docs/*.json
docs/_archive/
docs/ai-news/

# Track ONLY the onboarding pipeline under scripts/ (Stage 14 Phase-1 H#4).
# There is NO separate *.ps1 rule — the local helpers (load-design-env.ps1,
# pull-digest-archive.ps1) are protected only by /* + scripts/ not being
# re-included. So after re-including the dir, "scripts/*" MUST re-exclude its
# contents before onboarding/ alone is re-included. Verify with:
#   git check-ignore -v scripts/load-design-env.ps1   (must stay ignored)
!scripts/
scripts/*
!scripts/onboarding/

# ============================================================
# Workspace files — NEVER tracked
# ============================================================
# These exist in the working directory but are not part of Verdaca.
# Listed explicitly for safety even though /* already covers them.
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.claude/
Articles/
# Leading slash root-anchors this pattern — it must NOT case-fold onto
# the tracked kernel/memory/ package on the case-insensitive Windows FS.
/Memory/
CLAUDE.md
claude-setup-reference.md
# ============================================================
# Python development cruft
# ============================================================
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.hypothesis/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/
**/.tox/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/graphify-out/

# ============================================================
# Node.js / Next.js cruft
# ============================================================
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/.turbo/

# ============================================================
# Editor / OS cruft
# ============================================================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ============================================================
# Secrets (defensive — none expected but safety net)
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
.env.local
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
secrets.yaml
